{"template_key":"SMS-SLO-197","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey, it's Chris at Fundhub. I'm the founder of Fundhub. Here's 30% off the roadmap. It's $197: {{pay_url}}\nReply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-SLO-COUPON-01","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey, I appreciate you writing back. Here's 30% off the roadmap. It's $197: {{pay_url}} I'd love to hear how you like the product. We're going to take what you said and make this better, so this is worth your time.\nReply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-SLO-FIRST5-01","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey, it's Chris at Fundhub. I'm the founder of Fundhub. I want to give you the roadmap for free in exchange for hopping on a call with me. I'll do the soft-pull analysis in front of you so we can see how this can help you, and I want to hear what you didn't like about the product. You're one of the first people in my funnel, so this is free. I can help you, and your suggestions help me make the product better.\nReply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-SLO-FIRST5-REPLY","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey, I appreciate you writing back. You're in. The roadmap is free. Book the call with me here and I'll do the soft-pull analysis in front of you: {{book_url}}\nReply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-SLO-GENUINE-01","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey, it's Chris at Fundhub. Not trying to sell you anything. I want to know what we could do to make the page better, and the offer better. I've been in this for 10 years and I've seen a lot of people get burned. What are your concerns?","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-SLO-GIFT-01","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey, it's Chris at Fundhub. I'm the founder of Fundhub. What about this did you not like? Was it the page? Was it the offer? What didn't you like about the product? Tell me, and I'll give you an amazing gift. I think you're really going to like it.\nReply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-SLO-PAID-FORM-01","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey, it's Chris at Fundhub. Your payment went through. The file does not run until the soft pull form is in. Pick it back up here: {{form_url}}","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-VAULT-ASK-1","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey {{contact.first_name}}, Fundhub. To keep your file moving we still need {{vault.what}}.{{vault.more_phrase}} Upload it in your portal: {{CLIENT_PORTAL_URL}}{{vault.reply_phrase}} Reply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-VAULT-ASK-3","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hey {{contact.first_name}}, Fundhub. Checking in: we still need {{vault.what}} for your file.{{vault.more_phrase}} If something is in the way, reply here and a person will help. Portal: {{CLIENT_PORTAL_URL}} Reply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-WAYPOINT-DUE","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hi {{contact.first_name}}, it's Fundhub. This is due today on your file: {{waypoint.title}}. You can take care of it in your portal. Reply here if you are stuck. Reply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
{"template_key":"SMS-WAYPOINT-NUDGE-2","channel":"sms","subject":null,"body":"Hi {{contact.first_name}}, Fundhub again about {{waypoint.title}} on your file. It is still open. Reply here and we will help you get it done. Reply STOP to opt out.","compliance_passed":true},
